# .gtb/ignore — mark generated files hands-off for 'gtb regenerate'.
#
# One pattern per line. Patterns are evaluated top-to-bottom; a later rule wins,
# and a leading '!' re-includes a file an earlier rule excluded.
#
#   justfile                      a filename, matched in any directory
#   *.yml                         a glob, matched in any directory
#   .github/**                    everything under a directory
#   .github/workflows/ci.yml      an exact path
#   !.github/workflows/release.yml  keep this one managed by the generator
#
# Manage it with 'gtb ignore add|remove|list|check', or edit it by hand.
# See https://gtb.phpboyscout.uk/how-to/configure-generator-ignore/
.goreleaser.yaml
.gitlab-ci.yml
zensical.toml
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
go.mod
docs/**
renovate.json5

# Kept by hand, each for a reason the generator's template does not share:
# .gitignore also ignores .wrangler/ (the keys site is deployed with wrangler);
# .golangci.yaml lints test code, with scoped exclusions documented inline;
# .colophon.yaml announces releases to Discord and the release feed;
# .pre-commit-config.yaml is kept current by Renovate, ahead of the template's pins.
.gitignore
.golangci.yaml
.colophon.yaml
.pre-commit-config.yaml
